  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Imagine starting your day with a refreshing swim at Cheltenham Beach, enjoying coffee at a nearby café and having everything you need just moments from home. Beautifully renovated throughout, this low-maintenance three-bedroom, two-level townhouse offers modern comfort and an exceptional lifestyle in one of the area’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nInside, contemporary interiors, modern comforts and light-filled open-plan living create a welcoming space to relax and entertain. Step outdoors to your own private garden, perfect for morning coffee, summer gatherings or unwinding at the end of the day. A single garage plus carport provides convenient off-street parking.\r\n\r\nWith the golden sands of Cheltenham Beach, cafés, shops, parks, transport and a range of local recreational facilities including Waitemata Golf Course just minutes away.  This is easy, convenient coastal living at its best. You don't want to miss this one!\r\n\r\nStylish, comfortable and superbly positioned, this is a home you’ll be proud to call your own.",
